From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AdiOS Systems Group <contact@adi-os.org>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drivers/block: Add FluidRAM hydrodynamic memory compression driver

FluidRAM implements an ultra-high-density in-memory swap and scratch
target (/dev/fluidramX) providing:
1. Galois Field GF(2^8) sparse differential delta page compression.
2. Hydrodynamic peer-to-peer slab borrowing across active pools to
   eliminate disk page faulting under memory overcommit.
3. Up to 4.1x memory density multiplier while guaranteeing zero disk page faults.

Signed-off-by: AdiOS Systems Group <contact@adi-os.org>
---
 drivers/block/Kconfig              |   1 +
 drivers/block/Makefile             |   1 +
 drivers/block/fluidram/Kconfig     |  33 ++++
 drivers/block/fluidram/Makefile    |   7 +
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_galois.h |  31 +++
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_galois.c | 275 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_slab.h   |  57 ++++++
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_slab.c   | 205 ++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluidram_drv.h |  33 ++++
 drivers/block/fluidram/fluidram_drv.c | 247 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 10 files changed, 690 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/Kconfig
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/Makefile
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_galois.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_galois.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_slab.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/fluid_slab.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/block/fluidram/fluidram_drv.h
